    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107600" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερίστᾰμαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, with aor. 2 and pf.
		
			Act.
		:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stand
				over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνειρον ὑπερστὰν Ἀρταβάνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stand over</i> one <i>for protection, protect,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				188
			</span></i> (lyr.): abs., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.370
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>surpass,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				5.10.3
			</span></i>.</div>
